      "blocks": {
        "text_left_block_n8VY36": {
          "type": "text_left_block",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Taking care of your health should be pretty straightforward. But in today’s world, it isn’t. You might be on medication that doesn’t feel right. You could be taking supplements and don’t know why. You may not know where to turn. Too much choice is confusing. And the overload of information can leave you feeling overwhelmed. <\/p><p>settlehealth gives you clarity to find a clear path forward. Your journey with us is individually designed to work with you, for you. Our specialised clinicians are the best in the industry. We take time to listen. We’re compassionate to support you through every step.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "text_right_block_DfdpwT": {
          "type": "text_right_block",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We don’t just look at your symptoms. We go deeper to find the root cause. Quick fixes aren’t the answer to long-term health. So we work together to identify realistic lifestyle changes you can build into your daily life for lasting change.<\/p><p>Step by step, we help you increase momentum and raise energy levels to enjoy all that is good about life. Feeling your best allows you to do your best. And live your life in full colour.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
